{"id": 14, "ts": 1780433021.4380953, "event": "public_discussion_message", "round": 1, "agent": "emily_brooks", "message": "I appreciate Sarah\u2019s support for Candidate\u202fC, especially his ability to make correct decisions quickly and his excellent attention skills. However, his difficulty communicating ideas, being regarded as egocentric, and his lack of willingness to pursue further education raise serious concerns for crew cooperation and adaptability\u2014both essential for long\u2011distance operations. In contrast, Candidate\u202fB demonstrates very strong stress resilience (\u201chandles stress very well\u201d), is highly conscientious, and possesses solid technical abilities (good at assessing weather conditions and excellent computer skills). While he sometimes adopts the wrong tone, his overall reliability and technical competence outweigh that relatively minor communication issue. Therefore, I recommend we move our provisional vote to Candidate\u202fB as the best overall fit for the long\u2011distance pilot role."}
